# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Set from the initial commit deliberately: introducing this later rewrites every
# file in one churn commit. Vercel builds on Linux, so LF in the repo keeps CI
# diffs and local diffs identical regardless of who checked out on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must not be touched.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated: collapse in diffs and exclude from language statistics.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
